<p><%= mail_greeting %></p>
<p>Your EsignCenter account has used <%= @used %> of the <%= @limit %> document completions included in the free plan this month.</p>
<p>When the last one is used, new documents cannot be sent from this account until the limit resets on <%= @resets_at.strftime('%-d %B %Y') %> at 00:00 UTC. Documents already sent can still be signed.</p>
<p>The paid plan removes this limit: $<%= @price %> per user per month, with a <%= @trial_days %>-day free trial.</p>
<p><%= link_to 'See your usage', @usage_url %></p>
<p>Thanks,<br>EsignCenter</p>
